## Welcome! [:fa-calendar:](https://calendly.com/joe-sunstarsys/30min)

{# lede #}We practice [Open Science](triple-products) here{# lede #}.

## About Me

I'm an [INTJ-A](https://www.16personalities.com/intj-personality) type of person who cherishes the eclectic, abnormal, atypical aspects of life. I have mastered [Wing Chun](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qexxe6ANG2o) in High School, [Physical Mathematics](https://www.math.stonybrook.edu/~leontak/#:~:text=joseph%20schaefer) in University, and [Optimization Engineering](https://www.linkedin.com/in/joesuf4) in my Professional Career.

### Personal Life

Married to the most amazing woman on Earth, whose love for me blessed us both with a precious daughter.  We live in South Florida, and jointly operate my S-CORP <https://sunstarsys.com>, which provides the infrastucture hardware and software for this site.

### Delia Frees, to Me

> Are you familiar with the role the Heyókȟa plays in Native American culture? You, my dear, are my own personal Heyókȟa.

![Grok Heyoka](index.page/heyoka-grok)

I created <https://iconoclasts.blog> to cater to kindred spirits online; who need a public, censorship-free, long-form essay writing community &mdash; to share and interact with each other's most politically inconvenient, avant-garde ideas.

If that sounds like you, please [request a demo today](/contact)!

